WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.710 --> 01:33.070
A beautiful planet,

01:33.840 --> 01:34.980
our Earth.

01:35.540 --> 01:38.050
In order to steal our livelihood,

01:38.580 --> 01:42.550
aliens have been morphing into various forms

01:43.150 --> 01:45.490
and concealing themselves on Earth.

01:46.820 --> 01:47.760
That's right,

01:48.490 --> 01:52.560
there may just be aliens right beside you.

01:53.760 --> 01:54.970
Aliens are

01:53.760 --> 01:54.970
coming near you

01:53.760 --> 01:54.970
End

01:53.760 --> 01:54.970
Emergency Special Show

01:55.330 --> 01:56.770
That's awesome!

01:57.170 --> 01:59.200
I knew they were coming near us!

02:01.470 --> 02:02.870
I wanna meet them!

02:02.870 --> 02:04.470
Next

02:04.740 --> 02:07.340
we have the Nyan and Nandaru Corner!

02:07.340 --> 02:10.180
Cat? But dogs are better.

02:07.770 --> 02:10.180
There's the Galaxy Cat introduction too!

02:15.780 --> 02:17.290
Aliens...

02:18.520 --> 02:20.690
It'd be great if I could meet them.

02:22.620 --> 02:24.660
But how would they appear?

02:27.030 --> 02:31.170
Chocolat becomes a cat!?

02:34.670 --> 02:36.970
So cute!

02:37.440 --> 02:39.470
Eh, what is?

02:39.940 --> 02:41.040
The cat, the cat...

02:41.580 --> 02:44.110
The expressions and the
actions are all so cute!

02:44.110 --> 02:44.980
I really like them!

02:46.410 --> 02:48.880
I prefer cakes though.

02:53.420 --> 02:54.590
What's wrong with you?

02:54.990 --> 02:56.960
N-nothing...

03:06.900 --> 03:09.100
Rockin', my dear kittens.

03:12.970 --> 03:16.210
Today, I came to tell
you something important.

03:16.950 --> 03:18.980
Something important?

03:19.410 --> 03:19.980
That's right.

03:20.680 --> 03:23.220
A midterm exam is coming soon.

03:23.790 --> 03:25.590
Midterm exam?

03:26.090 --> 03:31.230
As queen candidates, in addition to
measuring your abilities like now,

03:31.230 --> 03:33.360
the midtem exam is something
extremely important.

03:33.760 --> 03:36.530
Huh, that'll be a piece of cake!

03:37.430 --> 03:41.400
Robin-sensei, what are we supposed
to do in the midterm exam?

03:41.970 --> 03:46.640
Hmmmm... unfortunately, I also don't know
the contents of the midterm exams.

03:47.010 --> 03:49.310
The Queen Selection Committee
of the Magical Senate...

03:49.310 --> 03:53.050
should be briefing you directly
on that particular day.

03:53.550 --> 03:56.650
Before that, the format
of the exam is a secret.

03:58.090 --> 03:59.150
I see...

03:59.850 --> 04:03.690
Well, just work hard collecting hearts
before the midterm exam.

04:04.230 --> 04:06.640
That's what both of you
need right now.

04:07.330 --> 04:08.430
I'm looking forward to it!

04:10.910 --> 04:12.450
That's easy!

04:12.450 --> 04:15.340
I'll just collect hearts as usual.

04:15.340 --> 04:16.800
It's not that easy!

04:16.800 --> 04:18.690
You haven't been collecting as usual!

04:19.670 --> 04:20.690
You're right.

04:22.640 --> 04:25.650
It's obvious that
Vanilla-chama is going to win!

04:28.880 --> 04:30.200
What should I do?

04:30.450 --> 04:33.290
If this goes on, I'll be far behind Vanilla.

04:35.760 --> 04:38.660
I have to think of a way
to gather more hearts.

04:39.830 --> 04:43.230
Private School Moegi Gakuen

04:43.460 --> 04:46.000
Did you guys see
what was on TV yesterday?

04:46.000 --> 04:48.800
I really want to meet the aliens!

04:49.100 --> 04:51.520
You're always going on about aliens...

04:51.710 --> 04:54.280
I've seen the cat show
after that, though.

04:59.270 --> 05:03.280
I'm only interested in real aliens, not movie ones.

05:03.750 --> 05:06.320
In the first place, do aliens exist?

05:06.890 --> 05:10.630
It's not the Galaxy Cat, so there's
no point watching it.

05:11.530 --> 05:14.120
What?! Aliens definitely exist!

05:14.360 --> 05:15.860
Don't compare them to ones in a movie!

05:17.270 --> 05:19.980
Strategy, Strategy, Strategy...

05:19.980 --> 05:20.840
Hey, Kato!

05:21.200 --> 05:23.100
Stra... What?

05:23.370 --> 05:25.720
Akira said that aliens exist.

05:25.720 --> 05:29.110
It's kinda childish though.
Do you believe in them?

05:29.110 --> 05:31.110
That's why I told you they exist!

05:31.110 --> 05:32.810
If that's so, show us the evidence.

05:33.680 --> 05:34.580
That's...

05:37.420 --> 05:40.260
You're actually an alien, aren't you?

05:40.690 --> 05:42.560
Tell them that!

05:42.560 --> 05:44.330
I'm not an alien.

05:44.600 --> 05:48.320
Compared to an alien,
I'd prefer a cute cat.

05:48.930 --> 05:49.530
Cat?

05:50.000 --> 05:52.500
You saw yesterday's show too?

05:52.870 --> 05:55.540
Yep. Cats are the best!

05:55.900 --> 05:56.800
They're so cute.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.770
Yeah, they are!

05:59.840 --> 06:00.810
Cute?

06:02.280 --> 06:03.810
That kind of cuteness is invincible.

06:06.180 --> 06:08.780
I've got no interest in
anything besides aliens.

06:09.250 --> 06:13.820
I'll find the evidence and make
everyone realize the truth.

06:14.160 --> 06:15.320
Wait for me!

06:15.890 --> 06:16.360
He ran away!

06:16.760 --> 06:18.330
It happens every time, though.

06:18.330 --> 06:19.330
Leave him alone, Taiji.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.460
Cat?

06:24.330 --> 06:27.900
Speaking of which, Vanilla did
say cats are cute, too.

06:36.410 --> 06:37.110
Pierre.

06:39.580 --> 06:40.980
He's petting a cat.

06:42.650 --> 06:45.220
Does Pierre like cats too?

06:46.190 --> 06:47.220
Cat?

06:47.620 --> 06:51.130
Yeah! Become a cat and be loved by everyone!

06:51.790 --> 06:52.930
It's a good idea, right?

06:54.200 --> 06:56.200
Somehow it feels otherwise.

06:56.800 --> 06:59.270
No matter what, we've gotta give it a try!

06:59.270 --> 07:02.700
Acting on your words is
one of your good points!

07:03.670 --> 07:05.240
But I m still worried.

07:05.240 --> 07:05.710
That's right!

07:06.040 --> 07:06.400
Huh?

07:06.710 --> 07:08.440
Just in case, let's do a divination!

07:12.010 --> 07:13.280
Sugar Sugar Rune!

07:13.680 --> 07:14.650
Choco Rune!

07:19.890 --> 07:20.360
Wand!

07:29.500 --> 07:30.100
Alright!

07:31.900 --> 07:33.270
Sugar Sugar Rune!

07:33.270 --> 07:34.340
Choco Rune!

07:35.800 --> 07:37.770
Divination Livre!

07:47.550 --> 07:49.150
A hidden talent.

07:49.780 --> 07:53.420
It's up to you how you use it.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.460
Believe in yourself!

07:59.290 --> 08:00.660
I believe! I believe!

08:01.030 --> 08:02.030
Alright!

08:05.830 --> 08:07.240
Have you heard the story?

08:07.240 --> 08:07.900
What is it?

08:07.900 --> 08:08.500
That is...

08:08.500 --> 08:10.010
Let's try this right now!

08:10.940 --> 08:12.310
Sugar Sugar Rune!

08:12.310 --> 08:13.140
Choco Rune!

08:15.340 --> 08:17.910
Turn me into a cute, cute cat!

08:25.450 --> 08:26.520
Oh, yeah!

08:27.090 --> 08:28.690
That's impossible...

08:28.690 --> 08:29.390
That's true.

08:29.390 --> 08:30.290
Ah, a cat!

08:32.460 --> 08:34.630
Wow, so cute!

08:38.570 --> 08:39.900
Yes, it went smoothly.

08:40.500 --> 08:41.770
Peek-a-boo glasses-nya!

08:42.300 --> 08:43.770
Eh, pee?

08:44.610 --> 08:47.500
If that's the case, I'll win with quantity
of hearts over quality.

08:48.380 --> 08:51.650
Your hearts, pick up-nya!

09:02.920 --> 09:04.290
Two pees...

09:04.760 --> 09:06.290
Let's move on!

09:09.830 --> 09:10.530
Akira.

09:11.830 --> 09:13.030
What's with this cat?

09:15.540 --> 09:16.400
Don't disturb!

09:16.900 --> 09:18.270
Shoo, shoo, go away!

09:19.170 --> 09:20.440
Oh, it's a cat!

09:22.680 --> 09:24.510
It's so cute!

09:25.380 --> 09:27.110
Are cats really that good?

09:32.120 --> 09:32.920
Somehow you...

09:34.120 --> 09:36.760
You seem cocky,
and that resembles Kato.

09:37.230 --> 09:39.030
What did you say? Nya'll whup your butt!

09:44.000 --> 09:46.630
It just said something!

09:48.100 --> 09:52.110
There may just be aliens right beside you.

09:53.310 --> 09:54.980
Come here, kitty!

09:56.010 --> 09:57.750
Come, come!

09:58.610 --> 10:00.450
What happened suddenly?

10:00.820 --> 10:02.720
Come, don't be scared.

10:12.090 --> 10:13.260
Stop it!

10:13.630 --> 10:14.550
Ouch!

10:16.260 --> 10:17.530
O-o-ouch...

10:17.530 --> 10:19.030
What're you doing?

10:20.640 --> 10:21.670
Don't be surprised.

10:22.140 --> 10:24.270
That cat came from outer space!

10:32.010 --> 10:34.280
What was he doing?

10:34.950 --> 10:36.450
Did it go smoothly?

10:36.950 --> 10:39.150
I could only get pees.

10:39.150 --> 10:41.660
That's no different from usual.

10:42.090 --> 10:44.460
Whatever Chocolat does, it's a failure.

10:44.990 --> 10:45.660
Shut up!

10:47.160 --> 10:49.000
I thought it'd go smoothly.

10:49.660 --> 10:52.600
In the meantime, I'll transform back into my
normal self and think of another strategy.

10:54.400 --> 10:55.870
What's wrong?

10:55.870 --> 10:56.770
It's not here!

10:56.770 --> 11:01.140
As a witch, Chocolat has always been
missing something, that I know --

11:03.910 --> 11:06.720
Stop the violence.

11:06.950 --> 11:08.050
What is it?

11:09.280 --> 11:10.690
Pendant's not here!

11:11.990 --> 11:13.490
What? Where is it?

11:13.490 --> 11:16.720
How? Without the pendant, I can't transform
back into my normal self.

11:17.190 --> 11:20.290
What should I do? What should
I do? What should I do?

11:22.230 --> 11:25.500
A cat that stands on two
feet and attacks a frog?

11:25.970 --> 11:26.990
It's a scoop!

11:28.740 --> 11:30.500
I'll go call Vanilla.

11:30.770 --> 11:33.570
But before that, Chocolat,
try to find it by yourself.

11:34.310 --> 11:35.110
Got it!

11:37.210 --> 11:40.310
How? What if I can't find it?

11:43.180 --> 11:45.950
Chocolat-chan, here's your milk.

11:48.020 --> 11:50.290
And these are fishy bone candy.

11:51.860 --> 11:53.330
That's delicious-nya !

11:53.730 --> 11:56.270
No way! Definitely no way!

11:56.830 --> 11:58.300
Pendant!

11:58.300 --> 12:00.070
Pendant!

12:11.310 --> 12:13.210
It's strange.

12:13.650 --> 12:16.880
I approached it in a friendly
way, why did it attack?

12:17.330 --> 12:19.020
It's 'cause it's a cat.

12:19.020 --> 12:21.520
If you try to catch it, it'll resist.

12:22.160 --> 12:23.190
Guess what!

12:23.520 --> 12:25.160
It's a scoop! A scoop!

12:25.560 --> 12:27.530
What are you so excited about, Nishitani?

12:27.930 --> 12:28.900
It's here!

12:28.900 --> 12:31.700
A cat who stands on two
feet and attacks a frog!

12:32.130 --> 12:33.020
Huh?

12:33.020 --> 12:34.840
It's the alien cat from just now!

12:35.700 --> 12:37.170
Alien cat...

12:37.770 --> 12:39.610
Even though you might not know this,

12:39.610 --> 12:44.450
aliens from outer space can transform
into all types of things.

12:44.700 --> 12:46.670
Then that cat is...

12:46.670 --> 12:48.780
An alien?

12:48.780 --> 12:50.320
I can't leave it like this!

12:50.320 --> 12:51.860
You guys come too!

12:53.150 --> 12:56.160
I'll show you the evidence
that aliens do exist!

12:58.090 --> 12:58.830
Not here.

12:58.830 --> 12:59.460
Not here.

12:59.830 --> 13:00.290
Not here.

13:02.000 --> 13:02.860
Chocolat-chan!

13:03.500 --> 13:04.370
Vanilla.

13:10.300 --> 13:13.040
Sooo cute!

13:13.040 --> 13:13.910
Vanilla.

13:15.040 --> 13:18.310
Sorry, Chocolat-chan. But you're so cute!

13:18.310 --> 13:19.880
I heard the story from Duke.

13:20.510 --> 13:21.920
Let's look for your pendant together.

13:22.480 --> 13:24.050
Thanks, Vanilla.

13:24.450 --> 13:28.260
What a stupid girl, to lose something
as important as her pendant.

13:28.260 --> 13:30.960
She should be disqualified
as a Candidate for Queen.

13:30.960 --> 13:33.870
She doesn't even need to take the exams.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.530
What did you say?

13:40.100 --> 13:42.400
My bad, my bad!

13:45.510 --> 13:47.270
I can't believe Blanca apologized.

13:47.640 --> 13:49.640
I suppose cats really are scary.

13:50.710 --> 13:52.860
It's not the time for this.

13:52.860 --> 13:54.690
I have to look for my pendant!

14:10.600 --> 14:13.230
We can't locate it,
even after searching so long.

14:13.230 --> 14:14.240
If this goes on...

14:15.800 --> 14:17.170
No way!

14:17.840 --> 14:20.040
Chocolat! I've found it!

14:30.380 --> 14:31.750
The dog's got the pendant?

14:33.250 --> 14:34.820
Quick, get it back!

14:36.660 --> 14:38.460
It was here just now.

14:39.030 --> 14:40.830
Did it escape on a UFO?

14:45.110 --> 14:48.030
What? Ice is chasing a dog.

14:48.870 --> 14:50.400
That's the alien cat!

14:50.870 --> 14:53.080
I'll get you the evidence this time!

14:56.240 --> 14:57.650
Wait!

15:00.010 --> 15:02.150
Oh no, I can't overtake it!

15:02.850 --> 15:03.720
Leave it to me!

15:05.920 --> 15:07.090
Sugar Sugar Rune!

15:07.560 --> 15:08.460
Vani Rune!

15:11.460 --> 15:12.030
Wand!

15:16.630 --> 15:19.630
Yahoo! I can reach it now!

15:23.470 --> 15:25.610
Vanilla! I c-c-can't stop!

15:25.610 --> 15:26.370
Vanilla! I c-c-can't stop!

15:29.480 --> 15:29.980
Chocol.at-chan!

15:29.980 --> 15:31.150
Chocolat-chan!

15:31.150 --> 15:32.150
Are you okay?

15:32.150 --> 15:33.750
Where's the pendant?

15:38.390 --> 15:39.520
The crow has it!

15:39.520 --> 15:40.750
Vanilla! Please!

15:42.460 --> 15:43.720
Sugar Sugar Rune!

15:43.720 --> 15:44.760
Vani Rune!

15:51.230 --> 15:53.370
Wait! You!

15:53.680 --> 15:55.400
It's a flying cat!

15:55.800 --> 15:57.610
Chocolat-chan! Do your best!

16:01.980 --> 16:03.010
Let go!

16:03.010 --> 16:04.910
Return the pendant to me!

16:09.480 --> 16:12.950
Wah! Vanilla! The wings disappeared!

16:16.860 --> 16:18.290
I'm falling!

16:20.190 --> 16:21.460
Seems like something fell down.

16:22.160 --> 16:23.220
In the forest!

16:23.970 --> 16:25.130
There's no mistake.

16:25.130 --> 16:28.000
It's the UFO for the alien cat!

16:30.070 --> 16:31.260
Oy, Akira!

16:32.540 --> 16:33.810
Chocolat-chan!

16:34.140 --> 16:35.240
Are you alright?

16:37.110 --> 16:38.780
Ah, my pendant!

16:43.080 --> 16:44.190
I can't reach it!

16:44.890 --> 16:46.220
Leave it to me, Chocolat-chan.

16:46.950 --> 16:48.190
Sugar Sugar Rune!

16:48.190 --> 16:48.990
Vani Rune!

16:55.560 --> 16:57.800
G-Giant cat!

17:02.970 --> 17:04.640
At last I can go back to normal.

17:05.170 --> 17:06.970
I'm so glad.

17:06.970 --> 17:10.710
Aaaahhh! Humongous alien cat!

17:10.710 --> 17:11.450
Akira?

17:13.150 --> 17:14.280
Wait!

17:15.280 --> 17:16.420
Wait, Akira-kun.

17:17.520 --> 17:18.420
Ah, UFO!

17:18.990 --> 17:21.020
Eh, where?

17:21.520 --> 17:22.390
There!

17:22.390 --> 17:23.220
There?

17:23.220 --> 17:25.190
Ah, this side!

17:25.190 --> 17:26.060
I think it's there.

17:26.060 --> 17:27.730
It's there?

17:26.060 --> 17:27.730
Vanilla, you rock!

17:28.560 --> 17:30.390
Alright. With this, I can return to a human.

17:35.340 --> 17:37.370
Huh, wait!

17:39.910 --> 17:42.080
Can't reach it at all!

17:44.650 --> 17:45.810
How?

17:45.810 --> 17:47.980
Vanilla, make me fly with your magic.

17:48.780 --> 17:49.550
I'll try that.

17:51.390 --> 17:52.490
Sugar Sugar Rune!

17:52.490 --> 17:53.220
Vani Rune!

17:53.720 --> 17:55.060
I'm going!

17:57.060 --> 17:57.790
Duke!

18:00.430 --> 18:01.860
Got it!

18:09.100 --> 18:09.740
Duke!

18:10.270 --> 18:11.470
The pendant?

18:11.470 --> 18:13.200
It's flowing away!

18:13.200 --> 18:14.540
Wait!

18:15.440 --> 18:17.710
Chocolat, it's dangerous over there!

18:20.180 --> 18:21.580
Got it!

18:26.900 --> 18:28.040
Chocolat-chan!

18:55.180 --> 18:55.880
Pendant!

18:57.180 --> 18:58.590
Thank goodness.

18:59.020 --> 19:00.550
You're awake.

19:04.060 --> 19:05.660
P-Pierre.

19:05.660 --> 19:07.590
While I was taking a walk
in the neighborhood,

19:07.590 --> 19:09.630
Cernunnos found you.

19:12.630 --> 19:15.270
That means this is Pierre's house?

19:18.610 --> 19:20.510
It's only for awhile, so bear with it.

19:22.780 --> 19:26.310
I-I'm being bathed by Pierre.

19:28.780 --> 19:30.020
Well, you're clean now.

19:42.230 --> 19:44.000
It's all good now.

19:44.630 --> 19:46.330
What should I do?

19:46.330 --> 19:49.300
Even with the pendant, I can't
change back to a human now.

20:13.090 --> 20:14.630
That jerk Pierre.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.460
When I meet him next, I'll whup his butt.

20:20.530 --> 20:21.840
Chocolat-chan!

20:22.370 --> 20:23.340
Vanilla!

20:27.770 --> 20:29.940
At last I changed back to a human-nya!

20:31.980 --> 20:35.080
Chocola-chan, you're still
talking like a cat.

20:36.320 --> 20:37.950
Thank goodness!

20:39.190 --> 20:42.020
It's great that Chocolat-chan
is a human again.

20:42.020 --> 20:43.630
Where were you up until now?

20:44.560 --> 20:46.060
Thanks, everyone!

20:46.630 --> 20:47.100
Eh?

20:56.800 --> 20:58.370
Ah, where did it go?

20:58.370 --> 21:00.140
That alien cat...

21:03.010 --> 21:03.510
Eh?

21:05.550 --> 21:07.200
The crowd over there is...

21:07.650 --> 21:09.480
Hey, don't dilly-dally over there!

21:09.820 --> 21:10.920
Sorry!

21:11.950 --> 21:13.620
Camera! Are you ready?

21:13.620 --> 21:14.620
Okay!

21:16.390 --> 21:18.160
A movie shoot?

21:19.790 --> 21:20.560
Hey, Akira.

21:21.030 --> 21:21.900
Look at that.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.530
A giant cat and...

21:27.900 --> 21:29.470
A cat that stands on two feet.

21:31.640 --> 21:34.730
Eh... if a cat is trained,
it can stand on two feet.

21:34.730 --> 21:37.810
Then what about the alien cat that I saw?

21:38.250 --> 21:40.750
Alright! A huge man-made satellite city.

21:40.750 --> 21:42.920
Galaxy Cat! Action!

21:44.380 --> 21:46.740
Ah, I'm so tired today.

21:47.050 --> 21:49.190
Because of you, my muscles are aching.

21:49.620 --> 21:51.990
Thank goodness I returned to normal.

21:53.130 --> 21:53.830
Besides that...

21:57.000 --> 21:58.540
Why are you blushing?

21:58.930 --> 22:00.700
N-Nothing.

22:02.140 --> 22:03.900
Something important, though.

22:03.900 --> 22:04.570
Huh?

22:05.210 --> 22:07.810
What about collecting a lot of hearts?

22:08.880 --> 22:10.410
I forgot!

22:10.410 --> 22:13.450
If this continues, you can't become a queen.

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.140 --> 23:47.660
This is bad!

23:47.660 --> 23:50.450
The midterm exam has started!

23:51.240 --> 23:52.850
The exam's theme is...

23:53.620 --> 23:55.890
To make girls' hearts shine.

23:56.880 --> 23:58.960
The Magical Queen's accomplishments

23:58.960 --> 24:01.950
include making girls respect her.

24:02.690 --> 24:04.400
Then, what should I do?

24:05.790 --> 24:08.260
Next on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.260 --> 24:11.010
Shining heart! Queen Candidacy Exam.

24:11.780 --> 24:13.820
Vanilla, I won't lose to you!
